    "show_share": true,
    "description": "For the team at the Aga Khan University (AKU) in Tanzania the International Women's Day is not just a one-day affair. It is marked through a series of events and activities over four days hosted by the University. This year, faculty and staff of AKU  engaged students and the community to bring the event's theme, \"Each for Equal\" to life through targeted activities.",
